uster=devel","images":["http://anarchistnews.org/.within.website/x/cmd/anubis/static/img/pensive.webp?cacheBuster=devel"],"language":"und","languages":["und"],"originCountry":"","originCountryCode":"","originRegion":"","sourceHomepage":"","sourceTags":[]},{"kontinent":"Global","categories":["Global","Movement News"],"primaryRegion":"Global","primaryTopic":"Movement News","secondaryTopics":[],"classificationConfidence":0.35,"classificationMethod":"editorial-review","editorialReview":true,"editorialReviewReasons":["low-topic-confidence","no-specific-topic-evidence"],"quelleName":"Anarchist News","author":"anonymous","title":"TOTW: Denial, Repentance, Restoration","link":"http://anarchistnews.org/content/totw-denial-repentance-restoration-0","pubDate":"Sun, 25 Oct 2026 10:11:25 +0000","content":"TOTW: Denial, Repentance, Restoration\n\n\n\n\nanonymous (not verified)\n\n\n\n\nSun, 10/25/2026 - 03:11","contentComplete":false,"image":"http://anarchistnews.org/.within.website/x/cmd/anubis/static/img/pensive.webp?cacheBuster=devel","images":["http://anarchistnews.org/.within.website/x/cmd/anubis/static/img/pensive.webp?cacheBuster=devel"],"language":"und","languages":["und"],"originCountry":"","originCountryCode":"","originRegion":"","sourceHomepage":"","sourceTags":[]},{"kontinent":"Global","categories":["Global","Movement News"],"primaryRegion":"Global","primaryTopic":"Movement News","secondaryTopics":[],"classificationConfidence":0.35,"classificationMethod":"editorial-review","editorialReview":true,"editorialReviewReasons":["low-topic-confidence","no-specific-topic-evidence"],"quelleName":"Anarchist News","author":"thecollective","title":"Getting Involved","link":"http://anarchistnews.org/content/getting-involved","pubDate":"Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:48:42 +0000","content":"Getting Involved \n\n\n\n\nIn this time of reduced anarchist projects, we’re seeing if there’s energy for us to expand a little. So this is us officially opening up to folks who want to be involved. Here are some of the projects that would be fun and simple to engage in. A list of more-involved options follows.\n\n\n\n\n1. Writing one, or some, opinion pieces for the podcast. You can read it yourself or have one of our regular voices read it for you.\n\n2. Writing a, or some, \n\nTopic of the Week prompts\n\n.\n\n3. Re-starting the ANews weekly digest (ATUBES) for printing out, leaving about, starting conversations with new people.\n\n4. Recording readings from The Anarchist Library for possible airing on the ANews podcast.\n\n5. Signing up to be one of the weekly conversants for the Topic of the Week prompt featured on the ANews Podcast.\n\nIf any of these appeal to you, get in touch via emai at: thecollective at anarchistnews dot org\n\n\n\n\nFor the future, maybe. (If there is one!)\n\n\n\n\nWe’d like to have a radio project. Imagine 24/7 radio stream that is at times live on air and at other times recorded. This would take probably at least a couple people who are consistent and dedicated. Is that you and a friend? You and an interesting enemy? You and a friend and an interesting enemy? Let us know!\n\n \n\n\n\n\nWe'd like to have more regular feedback and report backs from the various events that anarchists atten","contentComplete":false,"image":"http://anarchistnews.org/sites/default/files/inline-images/anews-keyboard-transparent-centered-text.png","images":["http://anarchistnews.org/sites/default/files/inline-images/anews-keyboard-transparent-centered-text.png"],"language":"und","languages":["und"],"originCountry":"","originCountryCode":"","originRegion":"","sourceHomepage":"","sourceTags":[],"webFeedTruncated":true,"webFeedOriginalLength":1720},{"kontinent":"Global","categories":["Global","Movement News"],"primaryRegion":"Global","primaryTopic":"Movement News","secondaryTopics":[],"classificationConfidence":0.35,"classificationMethod":"editorial-review","editorialReview":true,"editorialReviewReasons":["low-topic-confidence","no-specific-topic-evidence"],"quell